<!-- README.md -->
# Consolidation Fork

A modern fork of the [consolidation](https://github.com/tj/consolidate.js) template engine library with built‑in support for sending emails via [Forward Email](https://forwardemail.net/).

## Installation

```bash
npm install consolidation-fork
```

## Usage

```js
const { renderTemplate, sendEmail } = require('consolidation-fork');
const path = require('path');

(async () => {
  const html = await renderTemplate(
    'ejs',
    path.join(__dirname, 'templates', 'welcome.ejs'),
    { name: 'Bob', link: 'https://example.com/verify' }
  );

  await sendEmail({
    from: '"App" <no-reply@example.com>',
    to: 'bob@example.com',
    subject: 'Welcome!',
    html
  });
})();
```

