```env
FORWARD_EMAIL_HOST=smtp.forwardemail.net
FORWARD_EMAIL_PORT=587
FORWARD_EMAIL_USER=your_forward_email_username
FORWARD_EMAIL_PASS=your_forward_email_password
```

## License

MIT
